  "title": "HEICO CORPORATION ACQUIRES KEY SUPPLIER OF ARMORED VEHICLE TRACK SYSTEMS",
  "summary": "MIAMI, FL AND STANHOPE, UK – HEICO Corporation (NYSE:HEI.A)(NYSE:HEI) today announced that its Flight Support Group has acquired Cook Defence Systems and related entities (“Cook Defence” or the “Company”) to form HEICO-Cook Defence (“HCD”). HEICO owns 80% of HCD, with the selling entity, William Cook Holdings, retaining 20% ownership. Managing Director William Cook will continue to […]",
